# jemdoc: menu{MENU}{index.html}
= Chang He (何畅)

~~~
{}{img_left}{photos/changhe.webp}{Portrait of Chang He in Chicago}{218}{245}{}
I am joining the [https://cse.umn.edu/isye Department of Industrial and Systems Engineering] at the [https://twin-cities.umn.edu/ University of Minnesota Twin Cities] as a Ph.D. student in Fall 2026. \n
I received my Ph.D. in Management Science and Engineering from [https://english.sufe.edu.cn/ Shanghai University of Finance and Economics], where I was advised by [https://sites.google.com/site/isyebojiang Prof. Bo Jiang]. Before that, I received my B.Sc. in Mathematics from [https://english.ecnu.edu.cn/ East China Normal University] in 2021. During 2025, I was a visiting student at the University of Minnesota, working with [https://sites.google.com/umn.edu/shuzhong-zhang Prof. Shuzhong Zhang]. \n
My research interests lie in continuous optimization, with applications in machine learning and operations research. I am particularly interested in zeroth-order (derivative-free) optimization, Riemannian optimization, and first- and second-order methods. \n
E-mail: ischanghe \[at\] gmail \[dot\] com \n
[https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=5LpHDYAAAAAJ&hl=en Google Scholar]
~~~

